```
{
    "agent": {
    "plan": {
      "model": "anthropic/claude-opus-4-5",
    },
    "build": {
      "model": "anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5",
    },
  }, 
}
```

Here's my `opencode.json` for ruff and mypy (using uv, if you use pip just remove `uv run`).
You need `python-lsp-server` and `pylsp-mypy` packages intalled for mypy (and probably ```[tool.pylsp-mypy]
enabled = true
live_mode = true``` in pyproject.toml)

```
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "lsp": {
    "mypy": {
      "command": [
        "uv",
        "run",
        "pylsp",
      ],
      "extensions": [
        ".py",
        ".pyi"
      ]
    },
    "ruff": {
      "command": [
        "uv",
        "run",
        "ruff",
        "server",
      ],
      "extensions": [
        ".py",
        ".pyi"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

